---
---
<section id="hvorfor" class="bg-slate-50 py-16 dark:bg-slate-950 lg:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mb-3 h-1 w-10 rounded-full bg-brand-accent" data-animate></div>
    <h2 class="mb-10 text-3xl font-black text-brand-blue dark:text-white" data-animate data-delay="100">Hvorfor Multidata Consulting?</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-8 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:px-8">

    <article data-animate="from-left" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-brand-accent hover:shadow-md dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800">
      <div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-accent/10 text-brand-accent">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="mb-4 h-1 w-8 rounded-full bg-brand-accent transition-all duration-200 group-hover:w-16"></div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-blue dark:text-white">100 % Microsoft-fokus</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Vi jobber utelukkende med Microsoft-plattformen. Det gir dybdekunnskap som generalister ikke kan matche — og råd du kan stole på.</p>
    </article>

    <article data-animate data-delay="150" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-brand-accent hover:shadow-md dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800">
      <div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-accent/10 text-brand-accent">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M11.48 3.499a.562.562 0 0 1 1.04 0l2.125 5.111a.563.563 0 0 0 .475.345l5.518.442c.499.04.701.663.321.988l-4.204 3.602a.563.563 0 0 0-.182.557l1.285 5.385a.562.562 0 0 1-.84.61l-4.725-2.885a.562.562 0 0 0-.586 0L6.982 20.54a.562.562 0 0 1-.84-.61l1.285-5.386a.562.562 0 0 0-.182-.557l-4.204-3.602a.562.562 0 0 1 .321-.988l5.518-.442a.563.563 0 0 0 .475-.345L11.48 3.5Z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="mb-4 h-1 w-8 rounded-full bg-brand-accent transition-all duration-200 group-hover:w-16"></div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-blue dark:text-white">Seniorer i nøkkelroller</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Du møter ikke juniorer i forkant og seniorer i bakgrunnen. Vi setter erfarne konsulenter direkte i oppdraget — der beslutningene tas og kvaliteten synes.</p>
    </article>

    <article data-animate="from-right" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-brand-accent hover:shadow-md dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800">
      <div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-accent/10 text-brand-accent">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M3.75 3.75v4.5m0-4.5h4.5m-4.5 0L9 9M3.75 20.25v-4.5m0 4.5h4.5m-4.5 0L9 15M20.25 3.75h-4.5m4.5 0v4.5m0-4.5L15 9m5.25 11.25h-4.5m4.5 0v-4.5m0 4.5L15 15"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="mb-4 h-1 w-8 rounded-full bg-brand-accent transition-all duration-200 group-hover:w-16"></div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-blue dark:text-white">Fleksibel og skalerbar modell</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Med eget fagmiljø og et nettverk av spesialister kan vi raskt skalere opp riktig kompetanse — og ned igjen når behovet er dekket.</p>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>
